# Testing

- Tests live in `__tests__/` (not co-located under `src/`).
- Import `render`, `screen`, `fireEvent`, `act` from `@test-utils` (Redux + theme providers).
- Global mocks: `__tests__/setup.ts` + `react-native-unistyles/mocks` in Jest config — do not re-mock unless isolating one unit.
- Name scenarios after Jira AC when mapping spec-driven work (`describe('Jira AC: …')`).
- Prefer `testID` for interactions; match existing component patterns.
- After logic changes, run `yarn test` or targeted `yarn test path/to/file.test.ts`.